+  - Added the `sync_variables` durable worker job with typed payload validation, tenant-scoped service reload, scope/version checks, deletion-scheduled refusal, effective variable resolution across organization/project/environment/service scopes, and kind-specific Dokploy save-environment execution.
+  - Added typed Dokploy `SyncVariables` intent support for application, compose, and database services.
+  - Extended fake Dokploy with save-environment endpoints and request recording that redacts rendered `env` payloads.
+  - Marked `BE-0496` as passing in `ralph/prd.json`.
